{
 "source": "trapp",
 "book": "2CH",
 "chapter": 4,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.1",
   "range": "2CH.4.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "13c448be",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.1#p1-5df5259a",
     "text": "This altar was a type of the cross of Christ, yea, of Christ himself. \"We also have an altar,\" &c. {Heb 13:10}",
     "anchor": "Moreover, he made an altar of brass.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Heb 13:10",
       "ref": "HEB.13.10"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.1#p2-ba0c9464",
     "text": "That all the people might see the burnt offerings, and be reminded of their sins and of their Saviour; for the ceremonial law was their gospel.",
     "anchor": "And ten cubits the height thereof."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.2",
   "range": "2CH.4.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "bfe5dfef",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.2#p1-bfe5dfef",
     "text": "See on 1Ki 7:23, &c.",
     "anchor": "Also he made a molten sea.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 7:23",
       "ref": "1KI.7.23"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.3",
   "range": "2CH.4.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "12cf9b70",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.3#p1-12cf9b70",
     "text": "Haply called knops. {1Ki 7:24}",
     "anchor": "The similitude of oxen.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 7:24",
       "ref": "1KI.7.24"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.4",
   "range": "2CH.4.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2bfa0288",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.4#p1-2bfa0288",
     "text": "Prefiguring, say some, the twelve apostles, who carried the water of life all the world over. See 1Ki 7:25.",
     "anchor": "It stood upon twelve oxen.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 7:25",
       "ref": "1KI.7.25"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.5",
   "range": "2CH.4.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f368aab5",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.5#p1-f368aab5",
     "text": "See on 1Ki 7:26. There it is said \"two thousand baths\": Dicendum hic addi, &c., salth Vatablus. This prophet addeth what is wanting in the other; ea enim est mens autheris huius libri, for that is the design of this our author.",
     "anchor": "Three thousand baths.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 7:26",
       "ref": "1KI.7.26"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.6",
   "range": "2CH.4.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e975b444",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.6#p1-e975b444",
     "text": "See on 1Ki 7:37.",
     "anchor": "He made also ten lavers.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 7:37",
       "ref": "1KI.7.37"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.7",
   "range": "2CH.4.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f066530e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.7#p1-5f1cbca0",
     "text": "According to David’s pattern.",
     "anchor": "And he made ten candlesticks of gold, according to their form."
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.7#p2-93a4efbb",
     "text": "See 1Ki 7:49.",
     "anchor": "Five on the right hand.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 7:49",
       "ref": "1KI.7.49"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.8",
   "range": "2CH.4.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fd887e4e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.8#p1-c1a16e64",
     "text": "Lyra holdeth that all these were for shewbread, each of them having twelve loaves weekly set thereon, one hundred thirty-two in all. In our heavenly \"Father’s house is bread enough.\"",
     "anchor": "He made also ten tables."
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.8#p2-23b825c0",
     "text": "To receive the blood of the sacrifices. The blood of Christ is most precious, and must not be trampled on.",
     "anchor": "He made a hundred basons of gold."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.9",
   "range": "2CH.4.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9c55d62e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.9#p1-f32a48e5",
     "text": "See 1Ki 6:30.",
     "anchor": "Furthermore he made the court.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 6:30",
       "ref": "1KI.6.30"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.9#p2-d08b8d1f",
     "text": "i.e., The people’s court, called here gnazarah: {a} haply because here God helped the people, when he heard their prayers, or when here they took sanctuary.",
     "anchor": "And the great court"
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.9#p3-2656214b",
     "text": "{a} Forte ex azar fit azirum, et inde asilum."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.10",
   "range": "2CH.4.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8a8844ba",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.10#p1-8a8844ba",
     "text": "See 1Ki 7:39.",
     "anchor": "And he set the sea.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 7:39",
       "ref": "1KI.7.39"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.11",
   "range": "2CH.4.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "83dfe91c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.11#p1-83dfe91c",
     "text": "This diligent and exact description of these vessels of the temple showeth that all things needful to salvation are set down in the holy Scriptures, as Lavater well observeth.",
     "anchor": "And Huram made the pots, and the shovels."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.12",
   "range": "2CH.4.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6f6243b7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.12#p1-6f6243b7",
     "text": "Of these, see 1Ki 7:16.",
     "anchor": "And the chapiters.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 7:16",
       "ref": "1KI.7.16"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.13",
   "range": "2CH.4.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "209de5f8",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.13#p1-209de5f8",
     "text": "See 1Ki 7:18; 1Ki 7:20.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 7:18",
       "ref": "1KI.7.18"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ki 7:20",
       "ref": "1KI.7.20"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.14",
   "range": "2CH.4.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b37cea0e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.14#p1-b37cea0e",
     "text": "See on 1Ki 7:27, &c.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 7:27",
       "ref": "1KI.7.27"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.16",
   "range": "2CH.4.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "89a02dee",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.16#p1-89a02dee",
     "text": "i.e., Whom Solomon called father for his age and great worth.",
     "anchor": "Did Huram his father"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.17",
   "range": "2CH.4.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c53315cc",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.17#p1-c53315cc",
     "text": "In holes digged in the earth, without moulds did he cast them, say some.",
     "anchor": "In the clay ground."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.4.22",
   "range": "2CH.4.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6cc05953",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.4.22#p1-6cc05953",
     "text": "See on 2Ch 4:11.",
     "anchor": "And the snuffers, &c.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ch 4:11",
       "ref": "2CH.4.11"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
